#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/static/src/xml/privacy_lens.xml:0
msgid "Signed paper form seen?"
msgstr "Formulir kertas bertanda tangan sudah dilihat?"

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/static/src/xml/privacy_lens.xml:0
msgid "Start from a plain, neutral wording and change it to say what your company really does."
msgstr "Mulailah dari kata-kata yang sederhana dan netral, lalu ubah agar sesuai dengan yang benar-benar dilakukan perusahaan Anda."

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:pb_me_privacy.field_pb_privacy_notice__state
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Status"

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pb_me_privacy.portal_my_privacy
msgid "Thank you. Your answer is saved: you agree."
msgstr "Terima kasih. Jawaban Anda tersimpan: Anda setuju."

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/static/src/js/privacy_lens.js:0
msgid "That did not go through. Please try again."
msgstr "Belum berhasil. Silakan coba lagi."

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/models/board.py:0
msgid "That person could not be found."
msgstr "Orang tersebut tidak ditemukan."

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/static/src/js/privacy_lens.js:0
msgid "The answers could not be read just now. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "Jawaban belum dapat dibaca saat ini. Coba lagi sebentar lagi."

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/static/src/xml/privacy_lens.xml:0
msgid "The first 200 people are shown. Search for a name to find somebody further down."
msgstr "200 orang pertama ditampilkan. Cari nama untuk menemukan orang lainnya."

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pb_me_privacy.view_pb_privacy_notice_form
msgid "This is a starting point. Read it carefully and change it so that it says what your company really does with people's details, then publish it."
msgstr "Ini adalah titik awal. Baca dengan teliti dan ubah agar sesuai dengan yang benar-benar dilakukan perusahaan Anda dengan data orang, lalu terbitkan."

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/models/consent.py:0
msgid "This notice has been replaced. Please read the new one."
msgstr "Pemberitahuan ini sudah diganti. Silakan baca yang baru."

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/models/consent.py:0
msgid "This notice is not for you."
msgstr "Pemberitahuan ini bukan untuk Anda."

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/static/src/xml/privacy_lens.xml:0
msgid "This one is for HR"
msgstr "Bagian ini untuk HR"

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/models/consent.py:0
msgid "This person is in a company you cannot see."
msgstr "Orang ini ada di perusahaan yang tidak dapat Anda lihat."

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/models/notice.py:0
msgid "This version is already published."
msgstr "Versi ini sudah diterbitkan."

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:pb_me_privacy.field_pb_privacy_notice__name
msgid "Title"
msgstr "Judul"

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/static/src/xml/privacy_lens.xml:0
msgid "Until you publish one, nobody is asked anything. When you publish it, each employee reads it the next time they open My Payobook and answers \"I have read and agree\" or \"I do not agree\"."
msgstr "Sebelum Anda menerbitkannya, tidak ada yang ditanya. Setelah terbit, setiap karyawan membacanya saat berikutnya membuka My Payobook dan menjawab \"Saya sudah membaca dan setuju\" atau \"Saya tidak setuju\"."

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/static/src/xml/privacy_lens.xml:0 model:ir.model.fields,field_description:pb_me_privacy.field_pb_privacy_consent__version model:ir.model.fields,field_description:pb_me_privacy.field_pb_privacy_notice__version
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Versi"

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/models/notice.py:0
msgid "Version %s published. Everybody in %s is asked to read it on their next visit to My Payobook."
msgstr "Versi %s diterbitkan. Semua orang di %s diminta membacanya saat berikutnya membuka My Payobook."

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/models/notice.py:0
msgid "We keep the personal details you give us, and the details of your work with us, so that we can employ you, pay you correctly and meet our duties to the tax office and social insurance."
msgstr "Kami menyimpan data pribadi yang Anda berikan dan data pekerjaan Anda bersama kami, agar kami dapat mempekerjakan Anda, membayar Anda dengan benar, dan memenuhi kewajiban kepada kantor pajak dan jaminan sosial."

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/models/notice.py:0
msgid "We keep your details while you work with us, and afterwards for as long as the rules we follow require."
msgstr "Kami menyimpan data Anda selama Anda bekerja dengan kami, dan sesudahnya selama yang diwajibkan oleh aturan yang kami ikuti."

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:pb_me_privacy.field_pb_privacy_notice__website_message_ids
msgid "Website Messages"
msgstr "Pesan situs web"

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pb_me_privacy.field_pb_privacy_notice__website_message_ids
msgid "Website communication history"
msgstr "Riwayat komunikasi situs web"

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pb_me_privacy.portal_my_home_privacy
msgid "What we keep about you, and your answer"
msgstr "Apa yang kami simpan tentang Anda, dan jawaban Anda"

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/static/src/xml/privacy_lens.xml:0 model:ir.model.fields,field_description:pb_me_privacy.field_pb_privacy_consent__answered_on
msgid "When"
msgstr "Kapan"

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pb_me_privacy.portal_my_privacy
msgid "When your company publishes its privacy notice, you will find it here with your answer."
msgstr "Saat perusahaan menerbitkan pemberitahuan privasinya, Anda akan menemukannya di sini bersama jawaban Anda."

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/static/src/xml/privacy_lens.xml:0
msgid "Who has read your privacy notice and given an answer. Record paper consent for people without a login."
msgstr "Siapa yang sudah membaca pemberitahuan privasi dan menjawab. Catat persetujuan kertas untuk orang tanpa akun."

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:pb_me_privacy.field_pb_privacy_consent__wording
msgid "Wording shown"
msgstr "Kata-kata yang ditampilkan"

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/static/src/xml/privacy_lens.xml:0 model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pb_me_privacy.view_pb_privacy_notice_form
msgid "Write a new version"
msgstr "Tulis versi baru"

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/static/src/xml/privacy_lens.xml:0
msgid "Write the notice"
msgstr "Tulis pemberitahuan"

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/models/notice.py:0
msgid "Write the notice before publishing it."
msgstr "Tulis pemberitahuan sebelum menerbitkannya."

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/static/src/xml/privacy_lens.xml:0
msgid "Yes, record it"
msgstr "Ya, catat"

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pb_me_privacy.pbpv_status
msgid "You agreed"
msgstr "Anda setuju"

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pb_me_privacy.pbpv_status
msgid "You agreed on paper"
msgstr "Anda setuju di atas kertas"

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/models/notice.py:0
msgid "You can ask HR at any time to see the details we keep about you, to correct them, or to explain how they are used."
msgstr "Anda dapat meminta HR kapan saja untuk melihat data yang kami simpan tentang Anda, memperbaikinya, atau menjelaskan penggunaannya."

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pb_me_privacy.pbpv_status
msgid "You did not agree"
msgstr "Anda tidak setuju"

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pb_me_privacy.portal_my_privacy
msgid "Your answer is saved: you do not agree. HR can see it and may contact you."
msgstr "Jawaban Anda tersimpan: Anda tidak setuju. HR dapat melihatnya dan mungkin menghubungi Anda."

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pb_me_privacy.field_pb_privacy_notice__body
msgid "Your company's own wording. Employees read exactly this, in their language, before they answer."
msgstr "Kata-kata milik perusahaan Anda. Karyawan membaca persis ini, dalam bahasa mereka, sebelum menjawab."

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/static/src/js/privacy_lens.js:0
msgid "agreed on My Payobook"
msgstr "setuju di My Payobook"

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/static/src/js/privacy_lens.js:0
msgid "agreed on paper"
msgstr "setuju di atas kertas"

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/static/src/js/privacy_lens.js:0
msgid "not answered yet"
msgstr "belum menjawab"

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/static/src/xml/privacy_lens.xml:0
msgid "of"
msgstr "dari"

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pb_me_privacy/static/src/js/privacy_lens.js:0
msgid "said no"
msgstr "tidak setuju"

#. module: pb_me_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pb_me_privacy.portal_privacy_notice
msgid "uses your personal details, then give your answer."
msgstr "menggunakan data pribadi Anda, lalu berikan jawaban Anda."
